commit.message:
Retire viewer interaction manual tests

### Related

Part of RR-1120.

### What

Automates a few manual tests for viewer interactions:

#### Modal scrolling

```rs
for _ in 0..4 {
    harness.event(egui::Event::MouseWheel { … });
}

assert!(first_y_after < first_y_before);
assert!(entity_099_y < 600.0);
```

#### Plot override cloning

```rs
harness.selection_panel().click_label("Clone this view");

assert_eq!(cloned.query_range, original.query_range);
assert_eq!(
    cloned_instruction.component_overrides,
    original_instruction.component_overrides
);
```

#### Hover, Select, Deselect, and Reset

This is actually a whole lot of visual sanity tests, and the coverage
isn't perfect. Some parts (mostly double-click and hover based tests)
aren't covered well, but in general it should be good enough.

